{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platformer RPG about Felix the goblin who posses a demonic power of reincarnation! With it he must save his kind from eradication!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game dying is good \ud83d\udc4dDeath lets you upgrade skills to be reborn stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Gameplay:\u00a0</i></strong><i>Platformer RPG with combat that feels like early game Terraria.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/52c031de8c89c221f1731deb217c1fa2.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Felix,</strong>\u00a0a goblin fighting to protect the last of his kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/d06e52976e5ae7e936e3f2be61e8a0db.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goblin camp let's you prepare for battles by changing your weapons, gear and charms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/8668c0f9d0c4c7cc9d951e8a3a559fe4.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obor </strong>is\u00a0Felix's mentor. He is a legendary goblin warrior with wit and wisdom.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/31dc03dcc3f499b757ce1baffeed8419.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evelyn </strong>sells magic charms and helps Felix stay sane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/a4c088be7692906e5c61448419402c7b.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=734 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip charms to buff Felix's stats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/c17f0d50a454dcecce3ad6114ba93502.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world map will take you through several biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/259b0f1bc2b79b25dee6e4120236ff46.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/f180d3bf05996c408e91d80ed8c82f1a.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/beabb374c7d85b312fd97a956088b324.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/1fbc685db924976366cb677125871ec7.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/34e6dae4733720ce35c30c456fd6dbff.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Root</strong> is the skill tree. Feed it blood to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/6bb77e3045263b2d43a613bd8754a828.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game dying is good \ud83d\udc4dDeath lets you upgrade skills to be reborn stronger.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/12db6b922a69bfea12c563a3f521e3ec.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a legend and save your kind from the cult.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/b82df29cf1c16c4c2bafe78954bdcd96.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please support The Last Phoenix on Kickstarter Nov 1st (link in game) \ud83d\ude4f I'm a solo indie dev that needs your help.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299850?t=1761607714","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761607714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/e6b639e8907997a133d43bc4194358726e6d1e65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761607714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/e6b639e8907997a133d43bc4194358726e6d1e65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761607714","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},