://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/31dc03dcc3f499b757ce1baffeed8419.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evelyn </strong>sells magic charms and helps Felix stay sane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/a4c088be7692906e5c61448419402c7b.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=734 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip charms to buff Felix's stats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/c17f0d50a454dcecce3ad6114ba93502.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world map will take you through several biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/259b0f1bc2b79b25dee6e4120236ff46.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/f180d3bf05996c408e91d80ed8c82f1a.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/beabb374c7d85b312fd97a956088b324.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/1fbc685db924976366cb677125871ec7.avif?t=1761607714\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb